@startuml COM3_Technology_Classes

title COM3 — Technology Viewpoint — Structured Reference Architecture

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "F8TF.COM3.Domain" as Domain <<Technology Component>> {
  DeclaredOperation
  InvocationSignature
  TerminationType
  OperationInvocation
  OperationTermination
}

class "F8TF.COM3.Application" as Application <<Technology Component>> {
  Operation interaction processing
}

class "F8TF.COM3.Platform" as Platform <<Technology Component>> {
  technology bindings
}

class "F8TF.COM3.Api" as Api <<Technology Boundary Component>> {
  executable composition boundary
}

Domain <.. Application : depends on
Application <.. Platform : implements requirements for

Api --> Application : invokes
Api --> Platform : composes

note right of Domain
TECH-ARCH-COM3-01
TECH-COMP-COM3-01
end note

note right of Application
TECH-ARCH-COM3-02
TECH-COMP-COM3-02
end note

note right of Platform
TECH-ARCH-COM3-03
TECH-COMP-COM3-03
end note

note right of Api
TECH-ARCH-COM3-04
TECH-COMP-COM3-04
end note

note bottom
TECH-ARCH-COM3-05
Dependency Direction

JSON/RPC is a reference Technology binding
and does not define generic COM3 semantics.
end note

@enduml
